      "name": "Anisha Jain",
      "created_at": "2024-05-27T09:50:39.349Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello Everyone,</p>\n<p>I am currently using Frappe version 15. I’ve noticed that in this version, the “Prepared Report” button is automatically enabled. I do not wish to use the background report feature, so I would like to disable the “Prepared Report” button.</p>\n<p>Could someone explain why this happens?</p>\n<p>For your reference, I’ve attached a screenshot:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/9094a93ad7594c758bec886fde31d23aaec2eb6e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9094a93ad7594c758bec886fde31d23aaec2eb6e\" title=\"Screenshot from 2024-05-27 15-15-50\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/9094a93ad7594c758bec886fde31d23aaec2eb6e_2_690x257.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2024-05-27 15-15-50\" data-base62-sha1=\"kD1g9GuJndkwehgWxsRqphSfh0y\" width=\"690\" height=\"257\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/9094a93ad7594c758bec886fde31d23aaec2eb6e_2_690x257.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/9094a93ad7594c758bec886fde31d23aaec2eb6e_2_1035x385.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/9094a93ad7594c758bec886fde31d23aaec2eb6e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2024-05-27 15-15-50</span><span class=\"informations\">1257×470 31 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
