      "id": 411392,
      "username": "Mohammadali",
      "name": "Mohammadali Kharodiya ",
      "created_at": "2024-05-27T11:02:10.986Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/anisha_jain\">@Anisha_Jain</a><br>\nPlease go to Role Permission for Page and Report and select report and report name then uncheck the button Enable Prepared Report.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/0/a04953f2227b2adc3fece5c88d4ef0ab1d016ef4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a04953f2227b2adc3fece5c88d4ef0ab1d016ef4\" title=\"chrome-capture-2024-5-27 (2)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/0/a04953f2227b2adc3fece5c88d4ef0ab1d016ef4_2_690x173.png\" alt=\"chrome-capture-2024-5-27 (2)\" data-base62-sha1=\"mRXuYt6lNjCti67aqjsDbt0eMsY\" width=\"690\" height=\"173\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/0/a04953f2227b2adc3fece5c88d4ef0ab1d016ef4_2_690x173.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/0/a04953f2227b2adc3fece5c88d4ef0ab1d016ef4_2_1035x259.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/0/a04953f2227b2adc3fece5c88d4ef0ab1d016ef4.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">chrome-capture-2024-5-27 (2)</span><span class=\"informations\">1318×332 24.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Thank You!</p>",
